# 2-Cents Posts

## Emojis

Maximize related emojis in every post. Use them in:

- Section headings (e.g. `🏗️ A structure that scales`)
- Lead paragraphs and list items where they reinforce meaning
- Homepage card titles / tags when natural

Prefer topic-relevant emojis over generic ones. Do not sprinkle them randomly — each emoji should map to the idea next to it.

## Social / OG thumbnails — image grammar

Every post needs a dedicated Open Graph image at **1200×627** under `assets/img/two-cents/og-<article-slug>.png`.

Generate with the brand grammar script (do **not** freehand AI art for share cards):

```bash
# all default cards
.venv-og/bin/python scripts/generate_two_cents_og.py

# one-off
.venv-og/bin/python scripts/generate_two_cents_og.py \
  --title "My Article Title" \
  --out assets/img/two-cents/og-my-article-slug.png
```

### Required elements (every card)

| Slot | Content | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Logo | `assets/img/logo_color_clear.png` | Navy + red AT mark, top-left |
| Series | `2-Cents` | Top-right, accent color |
| Title | Article title | Centered, wraps if needed — **only variable** |
| Author | `Amirhessam Tahmassebi` | Bottom-left |
| Website | `amirhessam.com` | Bottom-right |

### Color scheme (site dark theme)

| Token | Hex | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Background | `#0f172a` | Card fill |
| Foreground | `#e8eef8` | Title + logo ink |
| Muted | `#94a3b8` | Author + website |
| Accent | `#4db8e8` | Series label, left rail, rule under title |

